{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/337522b8331ad754fdf46d0c4d941a6c.avif?t=1761910230\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Testimonium is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (15 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for FREE or donated to on Itch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one escapes Hell. <strong>Not truly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.poster.avif?t=1761910230\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.webm?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.mp4?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought it was just another Jehovah\u2019s Witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he opened the door, there was no one. Just a package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside: a VHS tape. No label. Just a symbol burned into the plastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He played it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/b628c5d0685469c27cddb22164dd978b.avif?t=1761910230\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimonium is a short analog horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside the tape \u2014 a rusted iron maiden, blood-soaked rituals, rooms bound to sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. Only the loop. Only the delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in a shitty apartment ends in a place far below \u2014 again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy 90s Art Direction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Atmosphere.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Minutes of Gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let the Spiral Begin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/e6c8665ae7a76e34385689ef1ce6de1fd7132806.jpg"},{"name":"The Hole Remembers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/78f727eb2670ed7ca80a6c1b49f3ff67b3498b23.jpg"},{"name":"The Nun Giveth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/e416b59895a6bd82bf7c4c4116454a54c2305484.jpg"},{"name":"He Comes Crawling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/c8e6bd2f48f01b8a3e2a103f5c21fd623afa10db.jpg"},{"name":"Let Him Take You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/684e1a592625e48105a829740a917804f8b68a42.jpg"},{"name":"A Mind Forged in Flesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/34840b2b6aed2c199b14548b72a26cabbea4a06a.jpg"},{"name":"Unholy Instinct","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953690/c92c3107aa80e0276797a9be04d3f2444d701d82.jpg"},{"na